R TRAVEL SEASON EVER, HILTON IS REVEALING ITS GAME-CHANGING TIPS TO HELP TRAVELERS MAKE THE MOST OUT OF THEIR STAY, THEIR BUDGET AND THEIR TIME. CATERING TO ALL MEMBERS OF THE FAMILY WHEN TRAVELING – INCLUDING FURRY ONES – THESE ESSENTIAL TIPS WILL HELP ENSURE FAMILIES VACATION WITH EASE. TIP NO. 1: CONSIDER A HOTEL THAT INCLUDES A HOT BREAKFAST A RECENT SURVEY BY HILTON1 FOUND THAT ONLY 19% OF AMERICANS REPORT HAVING BREAKF'}{'symbol': 'HUM', 'date': '2022-05-16 07:30:00', 'title': "HUMANA'S CENTERWELL SENIOR PRIMARY CARE AND WELSH, CARSON, ANDERSON & STOWE ANNOUNCE SECOND JOINT VENTURE TO DEVELOP AND OPERATE VALUE-BASED PRIMARY CARE CLINICS FOR MEDICARE PATIENTS", 'text': "LOUISVILLE, KY. & NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HUMANA INC.'S (NYSE: HUM) CENTERWELL SENIOR PRIMARY CARE AND WELSH, CARSON, ANDERSON & STOWE (“WCAS”) HAVE ESTABLISHED A SECOND JOINT VENTURE (“JV”) TO FURTHER EXPAND ACCESS TO VALUE-BASED PRIMARY CARE CLINICS FOR MEDICARE PATIENTS. THE NEW JV WILL DEPLOY UP TO $1.2 BILLION OF COMMITTED CAPITAL TO DEVELOP APPROXIMATELY 100 NEW SENIOR-FOCUSED, PAYER-AGNOSTIC PRIMARY CARE CLINICS BETWEEN 2023 AND 2025 AND OPERATE THEM TO PROFITABILITY. THIS JV BETW"}{'symbol': 'IBM', 'date': '2022-05-16 22:30:00', 'title': 'IBM ALERT: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF JUNE 6, 2022 IN THE CLASS ACTION FILED ON BEHALF OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION LIMITED SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK, NEW YORK--(NEWSFILE CORP. - MAY 16, 2022) - THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT A CLASS ACTION COMPLAINT HAS BEEN FILED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF INTERNATIONAL BUSINESS MACHINES CORPORATION (NYSE: IBM) ALLEGING THAT THE COMPANY VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS.CLASS PERIOD: APRIL 4, 2017 TO OCTOBER 20, 2021LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE: JUNE 6, 2022NO OBLIGATION OR COST TO YOU.LEARN MORE ABOUT YOUR RECOVERABLE LOSSES IN IBM:HTTPS://WWW.KLEINSTOCKLAW.COM/PSLRA-1/INTERNATIONAL-BUSINESS-MACHINES-CORPORATION-LOSS-SUBMISSION-FORM?ID=27329&FROM=5'}{'symbol':