NSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES...'}{'symbol': 'NFLX', 'date': '2022-05-14 19:45:00', 'title': 'NFLX EQUITY ALERT: ROSEN, A HIGHLY RECOGNIZED LAW FIRM, ENCOURAGES NETFLIX, INC. INVESTORS WITH LOSSES IN EXCESS OF $100K TO SECURE COUNSEL BEFORE IMPORTANT DEADLINE IN SECURITIES CLASS ACTION - NFLX', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WHY: ROSEN LAW FIRM, A GLOBAL INVESTOR RIGHTS LAW FIRM, REMINDS PURCHASERS OF THE SECURITIES OF NETFLIX, INC. (NASDAQ: NFLX) BETWEEN OCTOBER 19, 2021 AND APRIL 19, 2022, INCLUSIVE (THE "CLASS PERIOD"), OF THE IMPORTANT JULY 5, 2022 LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE. SO WHAT:\xa0IF YOU PURCHASED NETFLIX SECURITIES DURING THE CLASS PERIOD YOU MAY BE ENTITLED TO COMPENSATION WITHOUT PAYMENT OF ANY OUT OF POCKET FEES OR COSTS THROUGH A CONTINGENCY FEE ARRANGEMENT.'}{'symbol': 'NEE', 'date': '2022-05-16 16:39:00', 'title': 'NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS, LP ANNOUNCES ANTICIPATED EFFECTIVE DATE OF RESALE REGISTRATION STATEMENT WITH RESPECT TO COMMON UNITS ISSUABLE UPON CONVERSION OF 0% CONVERTIBLE SENIOR NOTES DUE 2024', 'text': 'JUNO BEACH, FLA. , MAY 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS, LP (NYSE: NEP) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT ANTICIPATES THAT THE RESALE REGISTRATION STATEMENT ON FORM S-3, PREVIOUSLY FILED BY NEXTERA ENERGY PARTNERS WITH THE SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION (THE "COMMISSION") ON APRIL 15, 2022 (THE "RESALE REGISTRATION STATEMENT"), WILL BE DECLARED EFFECTIVE BY THE COMMISSION ON OR ABOUT JUNE 7, 2022.'}{'symbol': 'NUE', 'date': '2022-05-16 07:30:00', 'title': 'NUCOR TO ACQUIRE C.H.I. OVERHEAD DOORS FROM KKR', 'text': 'INVESTOR CONFERENCE CALL AND WEBCAST TODAY AT 8:30 A.M. EASTERN TIME CHARLOTTE, N.C.'}{'symbol': 'OXY', 'date': '2022-05-16 08:30:00', 'title': 'OCCIDENTAL ANNOUNCES CASH TENDER OFFERS FOR CERTAIN OF ITS SENIOR NOTES', 'text': "HOUSTON, MAY 16, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- OCCIDENTAL (NYSE: OXY) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT HAS COMMENCED CASH TENDER OFFERS (EACH, AN “OFFER” AND COLLECTIVELY, T