GY COSTS. TO PREPARE ELIGIBLE CUSTOMERS ARE ENCOURAGED TO TAKE ADVANTAGE OF INCOME-QUALIFIED ASSISTANCE PROGRAMS INCLUDING: CALIFORNIA ALTERNATE RATES FOR ENERGY (CARE) PROGRAM SAVES 20%"}{'symbol': 'PNW', 'date': '2022-05-16 08:30:00', 'title': 'APS ADDING NEW CLEAN ENERGY RESOURCES TO POWER HISTORIC GROWTH IN ARIZONA', 'text': 'PHOENIX--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ARIZONA PUBLIC SERVICE CO. (APS) ISSUES A NEW ALL SOURCE RFP AND ADDS MORE THAN ONE GIGAWATT OF CLEAN ENERGY.'}{'symbol': 'RTX', 'date': '2022-05-16 10:56:00', 'title': 'RAYTHEON INTELLIGENCE & SPACE AND KORD TEAM-UP TO DEFEAT MULTIPLE MORTARS AND LARGE DRONES WITH STRYKER-MOUNTED HIGH-ENERGY LASER', 'text': 'IN A RECENT U.S. ARMY OPERATIONAL ASSESSMENT AT WHITE SANDS MISSILE RANGE, THE 50KW-CLASS HIGH ENERGY LASER WEAPON DEMONSTRATED REPEATABLE COUNTER-MORTAR CAPABILITY LAS CRUCES, N.M. , MAY 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- IN FOUR WEEKS OF CONTINUOUS LIVE-FIRE EXERCISES, AN INDUSTRY TEAM LED BY RAYTHEON INTELLIGENCE & SPACE, A RAYTHEON TECHNOLOGIES (NYSE: RTX) BUSINESS, AND KORD, A WHOLLY OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF KBR, DEFEATED MULTIPLE 60MM MORTAR ROUNDS WITH A 50KW-CLASS HIGH ENERGY LASER INTEGRATED ON A STRYKER COMBAT VEHICLE.'}{'symbol': 'RSG', 'date': '2022-05-16 09:04:00', 'title': 'REPUBLIC SERVICES CHARITABLE FOUNDATION AWARDS 10 NATIONAL NEIGHBORHOOD PROMISE® GRANTS FOR 2022', 'text': 'CLOSE TO $2 MILLION IN GRANTS TO SUPPORT SUSTAINABLE GREEN SPACES, COMMUNITY CENTERS AND HOUSING PHOENIX , MAY 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE REPUBLIC SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: RSG) CHARITABLE FOUNDATION TODAY NAMED 10 GRANT RECIPIENTS FOR ITS 2022 NATIONAL NEIGHBORHOOD PROMISE® PROGRAM, A NATIONWIDE COMMUNITY REVITALIZATION INITIATIVE. THE GRANTS WILL PRIMARILY SUPPORT LOCAL CHAPTERS OF NATIONAL NONPROFIT ORGANIZATIONS – REBUILDING TOGETHER, HABITAT FOR HUMANITY INTERNATIONAL AND NEIGHBORWORKS AMERICA – TO BUILD SUSTAINABLE GREEN SPACES, REFRESH COMMUNITY SPACES AND PROVIDE HOUSING FOR THOSE IN NEED.'}{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2022-05-16 04:53:00', 'title': 'SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE AND PGNIG ADVANCE NORTH AMERICAN LNG ALLIANCE', 'text': 'COMPANIES ANNOUNCE HEADS OF AGREEMENT FOR OFF-TAKE CAPACITY FROM CAMERON LNG PHASE 2 AND PORT ARTHUR LNG AGREEMENT CONTEMPLATES CONTINUED DEVELOPMENT OF A FRAMEWORK FOR GREENHOUSE GAS REDUCTION, MITIGATION, AND REPORTING MIĘDZYZDROJE, POLAND , MAY 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE, A SUBSIDIARY OF SEMPRA\xa0(NYSE: SRE) (BMV: SRE),\xa0AND THE POLISH OIL & GAS COMPANY (PGNIG) TODAY ANNOUNCED THEY HAVE ENTERED INTO A HEADS OF AGREEMENT (HOA) FOR THE PURCHASE OF APPROXIMATELY 3 MILLION TONNES PER ANNUM (MTPA) OF LIQUEFIED NATURAL GAS (LNG) DELIVERED FREE-ON-BOARD FROM SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE\'S PORTFOLIO OF LNG PROJECTS IN NORTH AMERICA. "TODAY\'S AGREEMENT UNDERSCORES OUR COMMITMENT TO HELP PROVIDE GREATER ENERGY SECURITY TO POLAND AND OUR GLOBAL PARTNERS THROUGH LONG-TERM LNG SALES," SAID DAN BROUILLETTE, PRESIDENT OF SEMPRA INFRASTRUCTURE.'}{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2022-05-16 08:00:00', 'title': 'CRAFTSMAN® CELEBRATES 95 YEARS OF BUILDING PRIDE', 'text': "AMERICAN TOOL ICON, CRAFTSMAN, CELEBRATES ANNIVERSARY WITH GIVEAWAYS INCLUDING AN ALL-EXPENSES-PAID TRIP TO THE JULY 31 INDIANAPOLIS RACE KNOWN FOR SOME OF THE MOST TRUSTED AND RELIABLE WARRANTIES IN THE INDUSTRY, CRAFTSMAN'S SIGNATURE RED TOOLS CONTINUE TO EXPAND AND EVOLVE TOWSON, MD. , MAY 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --AMERICAN TOOL ICON CRAFTSMAN®, A STANLEY BLACK & DECKER (NYSE: SWK) BRAND, IS CELEBRATING ITS 95TH ANNIVERSARY THIS MONTH BY THANKING ITS CUSTOMERS – THE HOMEOWNERS, HOME BUILDERS, AUTO ENTHUSIASTS AND MASTER MECHANICS – WITH WEEKLONG GIVEAWAYS INCLUDING A GRAND PRIZE TRIP TO THE JULY 31 INDIANAPOLIS RACE."}{'symbol': 'STLD', 'date': '2022-05-16 08:30:00', 'title': 'STEEL DYNAMICS ANNOUNCES PLANNED ACQUISITION OF A MEXICAN METALS RECYCLING COMPANY', 'text': 'FORT WAYNE, IND. , MAY 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- STEEL DYNAMICS, INC. (NASDAQ/GS: STLD) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT AS PART OF ITS NORTH AMERICAN 